@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "zendesk.frontend"

Feature: Zendesk Knowledge Capture App
	Testing functionalities of the Knowledge Capture App

Teardown:
	* I wait for "5" seconds
	* I teardown the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" from zendesk.liferay.com
	* I teardown users with the following userExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| User1 |
	* I teardown organizations with the following organizationExternalIds from zendesk.liferay.com
	| Organization1 |
	* I teardown articles with the following names from zendesk.liferay.com
	| A simple DXPC article |
	| A simple Fast article |

Scenario: Create and view an DXPC Fast Track Article
	Testing the ability to create an DXPC Fast Track Article on Knowledge Capture App

	Given I create an organization with the following values
	| Status           | Approved            |
	| Name             | Organization Name 1 |
	| Shared Tickets   | true                |
	| Shared Comments  | true                |
	| SLA              | Gold                |
	| Tier             | T4                  |
	| Support Region   | US                  |
	| Support Language | English             | 
	| External ID      | Organization1       |
	And I assign an organization with organizationExternalId "Organization1" with the following tags
	| liferay_dxp |
	And I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | zendeskqauser                    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | Organization Name 1              |
	| Language         | English                          |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)       |
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	And I create a request as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following values
	| Product                  | prd_liferay_dxp_7_4                              |
	| Component                | activation_key_project_administration            |
	| Tags                     | knowledge_capture_flagged_article                |
	| System Status            | production_functioning_with_limited_capabilities |
	| Subject                  | Request Subject                                  |
	| Description              | Request Description                              |
	| Organization External ID | Organization1                                    |  
	Then the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" should be assigned to the group "Self Service"
	And I log into zendesk as "zendesk.admin@liferay.com.broken" with password "zendeskqauser"
	And I create an Article with the following values
	| Ticket ID     | ${staticRequestIdList}            |
	| Template      | DXPC Fast Track Article           |
	| Name          | A simple DXPC article             |
	| Description   | A simple DXPX article description |
	| Review Status | Published                         |
	And I log into zendesk as "zendesk.admin@liferay.com.broken" with password "zendeskqauser"
	And I go to the ticket with the ID "${staticRequestIdList}"
	And I click on the apps button
	And I view an article with name "A simple DXPC article" and description "A simple DXPX article description"

Scenario: Create and view an Fast Track Article
	Testing the ability to create an Fast Track Article on Knowledge Capture App

	Given I create an organization with the following values
	| Status           | Approved            |
	| Name             | Organization Name 1 |
	| Shared Tickets   | true                |
	| Shared Comments  | true                |
	| SLA              | Gold                |
	| Tier             | T4                  |
	| Support Region   | US                  |
	| Support Language | English             | 
	| External ID      | Organization1       |
	And I assign an organization with organizationExternalId "Organization1" with the following tags
	| liferay_dxp |
	And I create a user with the following values
	| Name             | Zendesk User1                    |
	| Tags             | osb_customer,osb_kb              |
	| Password         | zendeskqauser                    |
	| Role             | End-user                         |
	| Access           | Organization                     |
	| Email            | zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken |
	| Phone Number     | +1 (555) 555-5555                |
	| Organization     | Organization Name 1              |
	| Language         | English                          |
	| Time Zone        | Pacific Time (US & Canada)       |
	| External ID      | User1                            |
	And I create a request as a user with the email address "zendesk.user1@zendesk.com.broken" with the following values
	| Product                  | prd_liferay_dxp_7_4                              |
	| Component                | activation_key_project_administration            |
	| Tags                     | knowledge_capture_flagged_article                |
	| System Status            | production_functioning_with_limited_capabilities |
	| Subject                  | Request Subject                                  |
	| Description              | Request Description                              |
	| Organization External ID | Organization1                                    |  
	Then the tickets with ticketIds "${staticRequestIdList}" should be assigned to the group "Self Service"
	And I log into zendesk as "zendesk.admin@liferay.com.broken" with password "zendeskqauser"
	And I create an Article with the following values
	| Ticket ID     | ${staticRequestIdList}            |
	| Template      | Fast Track Article                |
	| Name          | A simple Fast article             |
	| Description   | A simple Fast article description |
	| Review Status | Published                         |
	And I log into zendesk as "zendesk.admin@liferay.com.broken" with password "zendeskqauser"
	And I go to the ticket with the ID "${staticRequestIdList}"
	And I click on the apps button
	And I view an article with name "A simple Fast article" and description "A simple Fast article description"